<h2>A personal connection to rallying</h2>
<p>I grew up around rallying as a marshal and worked my way up to Safety Officer for a BTRDA event. I haven’t been actively involved for many years, but I still enjoy the sport. Love Rallying is my way of contributing to a community that has been part of my life for a long time.</p>

<p><strong>Explore the events and results on Love Rallying.</strong></p>